Subject: [PATCH] pci: ignore the on board cypress wlan chip, do not disable
 MSI capability

Change-Id: I32765398146e2a4b59e3de8eeda6e910b36dadb8
Signed-off-by: Xueqiang Gong <quic_gongx@quicinc.com>
